<</Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/Alt (Figure 2: the runner. The repository and the pull request, the changed code, the policy files and the earlier plan comments, are the agent's input. The agent runs in a sandbox and reaches Turf's MCP server on the host through the gateway; the host runs the server, the engine and restate-server with a one-hour AWS session minted by OIDC from the GitHub Environment's role. The engine talks to AWS Lambda and the S3 state. The agent's comment, review and label return to the pull request through safe outputs.)
